### Per-key event streams require authentication
GET {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/studios/runs/events
Accept: text/event-stream

?? status == 401

###

### Per-run event streams require authentication
GET {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/studios/runs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/events
Accept: text/event-stream

?? status == 401

###

### Authenticate
# @name login
POST {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
  "password": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

?? status == 200

###

### A private HTTP target is refused — never register a local service as a callback
POST {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/studios/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8080/orazaka-contract",
  "events": ["run.completed", "run.failed"]
}

?? status == 400

###

### The authenticated caller can list endpoints without exposing their secrets
GET {{$dotenv ROUTER_URL}}/api/v1/studios/webhooks
Authorization: Bearer {{login.token}}

?? status == 200
?? js Array.isArray(response.parsedBody) == true
?? js response.parsedBody.filter(endpoint => Object.hasOwn(endpoint, "secret")).length == 0
